{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "1788798055000-747602", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "出差住宿标准定多少合适？一线和经理要不要区分？", "id": "9be72391a2b74238bc61a1e3a5e15778", "created_at": "2026-09-07T16:20:55", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "1270afd3b1f14490a245e3abb55ee81a", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-07T16:20:55", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "a0da36ae6d19484190fa88e7a30bbf01", "created_at": "2026-09-07T16:21:03", "finished_at": "2026-09-07T16:21:45"}, {"type": "text", "text": "建议两档：**一线员工 300 元/晚、经理级 450 元/晚**（北上广深可上浮 20%）。\n同性别同事出差鼓励拼房，拼房时标准可合并使用（即两人合计 600/900）。超标准部分自付，除非住宿紧张地区提前报备。", "id": "8ecc5582423345cd9d48bfa25ad6a463", "created_at": "2026-09-07T16:21:03", "finished_at": "2026-09-07T16:21:45"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "a48501f0389c46d7ab1232cd3bc3344d", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-07T16:21:03", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-07T16:21:45", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "补贴按什么天计算？", "id": "e733107361dd4b238f1c75db28515b21", "created_at": "2026-09-07T16:23:45", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "b441875a0c9e4e84b7fadb59f3461c7c", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-07T16:23:45", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "1c8bf2d0db8445fabf964b50b067991b", "created_at": "2026-09-07T16:23:51", "finished_at": "2026-09-07T16:24:21"}, {"type": "text", "text": "按自然天：出差期间含周末都算在途；若周末无工作安排，往返当日算、中间周末不算——制度里写死一种口径避免扯皮。", "id": "364c2a49e88941ad9b0f0b80b66810e2", "created_at": "2026-09-07T16:23:51", "finished_at": "2026-09-07T16:24:21"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "ba6ace3a44494397a7502e9bd1bc20e4", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-07T16:23:51", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-07T16:24:21", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}], "reply_context": {}, "permission_context": {}, "tool_context": {}, "tasks_context": {}, "middle_context": {}}}}